      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know... i thought being alone would finally make things quiet. i thought if i just cut everyone out, the noise would stop. but now it's just... too quiet. it feels like i'm just sitting in a room that's getting smaller every single day. i've built this life to be safe, but now i'm just trapped in it. i can't see a way out that doesn't involve losing everything i've worked for.",
