      "content": "it just feels like i'm stuck in a loop. i tried to protect myself from the world, but i just ended up making a cage where nothing can happen anymore. nothing changes, nothing grows, it's just... stagnant. everything i do to try and fix it just makes the walls feel thicker. like there's no version of this life where i actually feel free again.",
